==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

